。","startedSeq":1720,"endedSeq":1830,"startedAt":"1788561107Z","endedAt":"1788561108Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1348,"revision":1830,"observedAt":"1788561108Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788561108Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788561108,"revision":1830,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_003f9ea2b798c213016a9b46c4c35087d0b06745341e8e279f","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-1834","seq":1834,"timestamp":"1788561113Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":1834,"endedSeq":2168,"startedAt":"1788561113Z","endedAt":"1788561630Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":1834,"activityEndSeq":2168,"totalEventCount":49,"toolCallCount":42,"thoughtCount":7,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":7,"writtenFileCount":8,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_03f993f58ca83c6e016a9b48d4bef887d0a6a954fa90563bcf","seq":2271,"timestamp":"1788561630Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"SQLite TCK 的两个失败揭示了持久 wrapper 的真实边界错误，而非测试问题：一是 transition 已执行补偿并抛错时 wrapper 没有提交补偿状态；二是写后返回了编码前对象，而持久读取是 codec 规范化对象。修复方向是在异常路径比较 before/after 并提交已发生的补偿，再原样抛错；canonical update/fork 返回 durable read-back，使调用方与重启后事实完全一致。","startedSeq":2169,"endedSeq":2271,"startedAt":"1788561630Z","endedAt":"1788561631Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1871,"revision":2271,"observedAt":"1788561631Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788561631Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788561631,"revision":2271,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_03f993f58ca83c6e016a9b48d4bef887d0a6a954fa90563bcf","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-2272","seq":2272,"timestamp":"1788561631Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":2272,"endedSeq":2317,"startedAt":"1788561631Z","endedAt":"1788561682Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":2272,"activityEndSeq":2317,"totalEventCount":6,"toolCallCount":5,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":1,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0cdc1c1a6fb36416016a9b490a3be087d0a5e764e15d0a0fd6","seq":2449,"timestamp":"1788561682Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"fee68e41-144f-4335-b7b3-1ce6a2a262ae","content":"持久 HostStore 的 18 项共享 TCK 已在 SQLite 上全绿。性能评审：当前 wrapper 每个命令仅加载一个 Session 聚合，目录页只读五列，锁不跨 Provider/Tool I/O；代价是单 Session 每次写会重编码其 durable event history，后续必须通过有界 replay/compaction 保持规模上限，当前不为尚未测量的瓶颈增加第二状态模型。现在补重启、并发 CAS、故障回滚证据，然后在同一 adapter 增加 FTS5 可重建投影与绑定 cursor。","startedSeq":2318,"endedSeq":2449,"startedAt":"1788561682Z","endedAt":"1788561684Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":1924,"revision":2449,"observedAt":"1788561684Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788559760Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788561684Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":0,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788559760,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788561684,"revision":2449,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0cdc1c1a6fb36416016a9b490a3be087d0a5e764e15d0a0fd6","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutp